<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI Needs Guardrails, Curation, and Privacy Discipline</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            overflow: hidden;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #0b192c;
            position: relative;
        }

        .shell {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .content-container {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 1;
            padding: 120px 140px 200px 140px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .header-section {
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 64px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.1;
            color: #0b192c;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .subheader {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #4a5568;
            line-height: 1.3;
            max-width: 1400px;
        }

        .citations {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #718096;
            vertical-align: super;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .framework-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            height: 480px;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .pillar {
            width: 30%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        .pillar-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .pillar-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-right: 20px;
        }

        .icon-oversight { background-color: rgba(11, 25, 44, 0.1); color: #0b192c; }
        .icon-curation { background-color: rgba(0, 102, 204, 0.1); color: #0066cc; }
        .icon-privacy { background-color: rgba(204, 0, 51, 0.1); color: #cc0033; }

        .pillar-title {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0b192c;
        }

        .pillar-content {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
        }

        .pillar-line {
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .pillar-line::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: -4px;
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .pillar-text {
            font-size: 22px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #4a5568;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .connection-line {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 30%;
            width: 5%;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #cbd5e1;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .connection-line.right {
            left: 65%;
        }

        .guardrail-overlay {
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            left: -20px;
            right: -20px;
            bottom: -20px;
            border: 3px dashed #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 24px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .guardrail-label {
            position: absolute;
            top: -16px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 0 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #64748b;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <img class="shell" src="../../../../templates/saem-annual-meeting-template-v1/template.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="header-section">
            <h1>AI needs guardrails, curation, and privacy discipline.</h1>
            <div class="subheader">
                In educational workflows, human oversight becomes more important, not less. <span class="citations">[6, 9, 15, 18]</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="main-content">
            <div class="framework-container">

                <div class="guardrail-overlay">
                    <div class="guardrail-label">Educational Governance Framework</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pillar 1: Oversight -->
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-header">
                        <div class="pillar-icon icon-oversight">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M2 12C2 12 5 5 12 5C19 5 22 12 22 12C22 12 19 19 12 19C5 19 2 12 2 12Z"></path>
                                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pillar-title">Oversight</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar-content">
                        <div class="pillar-line" style="width: 80%;"></div>
                        <div class="pillar-text">Faculty must remain the final arbiter of clinical accuracy and educational value.</div>
                        <div class="pillar-line" style="width: 60%; margin-top: 40px;"></div>
                        <div class="pillar-text" style="font-size: 18px; color: #718096;">AI acts as an assistant, not an autonomous instructor.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pillar 2: Curation -->
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-header">
                        <div class="pillar-icon icon-curation">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                                <polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline>
                                <line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"></line>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pillar-title">Curation</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar-content">
                        <div class="pillar-line" style="width: 90%;"></div>
                        <div class="pillar-text">Generated content requires structured review before reaching learners.</div>
                        <div class="pillar-line" style="width: 70%; margin-top: 40px;"></div>
                        <div class="pillar-text" style="font-size: 18px; color: #718096;">Maintain alignment with institutional standards.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pillar 3: Privacy -->
                <div class="pillar">
                    <div class="pillar-header">
                        <div class="pillar-icon icon-privacy">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                                <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pillar-title">Privacy</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pillar-content">
                        <div class="pillar-line" style="width: 75%;"></div>
                        <div class="pillar-text">Strict adherence to HIPAA and institutional data policies is non-negotiable.</div>
                        <div class="pillar-line" style="width: 85%; margin-top: 40px;"></div>
                        <div class="pillar-text" style="font-size: 18px; color: #718096;">De-identify all clinical scenarios used for generation.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
